Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 29 07:36:18 2026 +1100

    tests: Wait for the OVN agent before using a new chassis
    
    Four ovn_l3 functional tests wait for the Chassis row and then look up
    its agent, but the agent cache is filled from the Chassis_Private row,
    written after it, so get_agent() could still raise AgentNotFound. They
    now also wait until the agent is in the cache.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (medium effort)
    Change-Id: Idfd0869609938d6ca111ad32b9c6620cfe719895
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

